# PM I ✱25 source witness

First edition pp. 241–244, canonical scan and Project Gutenberg 78050.
This chapter gives the relation analogues of ✱24.  Exact numbered targets
✱25·01–03, ✱25·1–17, ✱25·21–27, ✱25·3–495, and ✱25·5–63 are transcribed
without gaps by the six `Principia.Architecture.Star25*Kernel` modules.

The notation is represented there extensionally and type-safely:
`Relation Left Right = Left → Right → Prop`; dotted `V`, dotted `Λ`,
`⪽`, dotted intersection/union/difference, and dotted existence are respectively
`universalRelation`, `nullRelation`, `Included`, `intersection`, `union`,
`difference`, and `existsRelation`.  Thus both argument types printed as fixed
by context remain explicit in every formal target.
